ll warden.","conflict":"Mara must let go of her fear of being the alarmist and trust that the shared work will hold without her alone at the gate.","outcome":"The gates run clear, Mara accepts help in keeping them, and the city keeps the tide that powers it.","depends_on":["scn_new_calendar"]}]}]}
