air remembers the taste of each tea that sealed a bargain, and that the Ninth Stall's old recipe may carry the claim. Poppy brews her grandmother's blend for her.","location_id":"loc_wishing_barn","character_ids":["chr_mabel_thorn","chr_poppy_wren"],"goal":"Poppy wants to learn how to make the fair's memory carry her claim, and Mabel wants to teach without breaking her neutral role.","conflict":"Mabel lets the rules do her kindness and hints rather than speaks. Poppy's doubt makes her think the hints are refusals.","outcome":"Poppy learns the stall's old recipe must be served and recognised to prove descent. She also learns that an unkept favour is what lost the stall, and that she must find who it was owed to.","depends_on":["scn_damson_courts_the_round"]},{"id":"scn_carter_secrets","title":"The Carters' Closed Wains","summary":"Poppy goes among the Carter Kin on Leap Lane to find the ledger Damson read. She offers a trade of tea and a small favour for a look at the lane's secrets.","location_id":"loc_leap_lane","character_ids":["chr_poppy_wren","chr_damson_grey"],"goal":"Poppy wants to see the old ledger and learn whom the forfeited favour was owed to.","conflict":"Damson offers a bargain: she may see the ledger if she gives up the claim. He means it as a settling and tells himself it is fair. Poppy is tempted by certainty and nearly accepts.","outcome":"Poppy refuses, and as she leaves she glimpses a page naming the forfeited favour. She now knows it was owed to the Carter Kin and that Damson knows the claim is real.","depends_on":["scn_mabel_lessons_in_memory"]},{"id":"scn_the_bargain_contest","title":"The Contest of Cups","summary":"The Round holds a tea contest to settle whether to hear the claim before the sale. Poppy and Damson each serve a cup, and the Round judges by taste and truth.","location_id":"loc_kettle_commons","character_ids":["chr_poppy_wren","chr_damson_grey","chr_mabel_thorn"],"goal":"Poppy wants the Round to agree to hear her claim before the sale. Damson wants the Round to dismiss it as unproved.","conflict":"Damson argues a clause to the letter, and Poppy stumbles on her words. Her taste-truthing lets her sense sincerity in the shared cup but cannot prove it to others. Mabel will not intervene beyond the contest rules, and no one is harmed.","outcome":"Poppy wins by a narrow vote and the Round agrees to hear the claim before the third bell of closing day. Damson loses the quick sale and becomes more desperate.","depends_on":["scn_carter_secrets"]},{"id":"scn_the_unkept_favour","title":"The Favour Owed","summary":"The night before closing day, Poppy learns from Mabel that the forfeited favour was a cup of tea promised to a carter and never delivered. It can still be kept before the fair moves.","location_id":"loc_wishing_barn","character_ids":["chr_poppy_wren","chr_mabel_thorn"],"goal":"Poppy wants to know exactly what favour must be kept. Mabel wants to tell her without breaking the rule of ruling by tags alone.","conflict":"Mabel admits she has kept the old tag quietly on record for years, and Poppy feels betrayed. Poppy fears the fair will judge her unworthy, and the favour must be kept by the last bell.","outcome":"Poppy decides to keep the old favour herself and brews the promised cup. She goes to the Carter Kin to deliver it, knowing the time is short.","depends_on":["scn_the_bargain_contest"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Third Bell","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_closing_day_claim","title":"Closing Day at the Ninth Stall","summary":"On closing day the lanes begin to fold. Poppy brings the promised cup to the Carter Kin at the Ninth Stall as Damson tries to finish the sale before the third bell.","location_id":"loc_ninth_stall","character_ids":["chr_poppy_wren","chr_damson_grey","chr_mabel_thorn"],"goal":"Poppy wants to keep the old favour and claim the lease before the third bell. Damson wants to complete the sale before the claim is proved.","conflict":"Damson cites clause after clause to stall her. Poppy must speak her claim plainly and without apology, and Mabel's tag will only count if Mabel reads it aloud against the carters' resentment.","outcome":"Poppy speaks without apologising. Mabel reads the old tag aloud, and the fair remembers with her. The cup is accepted and the favour is kept before the third bell, so the lease passes to Poppy's family and Damson's sale fails."}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"What the Fair Remembers","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_damson_reads_back","title":"The Lease Reads Back","summary":"Damson reads the lease and finds a clause that names the carters' own part in the forfeiture. He settles it by bargain with the Tallykeepers: his factor's share is recorded as a favour owed to Poppy's stall, to be paid in trade.","location_id":"loc_wishing_barn","character_ids":["chr_damson_grey","chr_mabel_thorn","chr_poppy_wren"],"goal":"Damson wants a fair settlement that gives him some share. The Tallykeepers want the debt properly recorded.","conflict":"Damson must admit he knew the claim was real. Mabel records it plainly, and the carters resent a tag read aloud. Poppy must decide whether to accept the bargain without apologising.","outcome":"A new tag is hung binding Damson to supply the Ninth Stall's trade and sharing its custom. The conflict ends by bargain and nobody is harmed.","depends_on":["scn_closing_day_claim"]},{"id":"scn_opening_the_ninth","title":"The Ninth Stall Opens","summary":"Poppy unshutters the Ninth Stall and serves the first cup to the stallholders and the Carter Kin. The lanes begin to fold as she stands behind her own counter.","location_id":"loc_ninth_stall","character_ids":["chr_poppy_wren","chr_mabel_thorn","chr_damson_grey"],"goal":"Poppy wants to open the stall and serve her family's tea before the fair folds its lanes.","conflict":"The lanes are folding and there is little time. Poppy has to receive thanks and the fair's judgment without apologising for taking her place.","outcome":"Poppy holds her family's stall and names it for her grandmother. Mabel and Damson each take a cup, and the fair moves on with the promise kept.","depends_on":["scn_damson_reads_back"]}]}]}
