ing to the compact's long exclusion from guild-sealed routes.","location_id":"loc_tether_docks","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass"],"goal":"Sable wants the map surrendered for arbitration; Rho wants to hold it until the compact's claim is conceded.","conflict":"Rho will not admit his fence was wrong because the cause feels right, and Sable's charter calls his holding piracy.","outcome":"Rho agrees to appear at the Long Hall only if the compact's claim is heard, but keeps the map aboard his ship.","depends_on":["scn_reading_the_seal"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Stacked Claims","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_kest_offer","title":"Kest's Offer in the Core Vaults","summary":"Kest Inger receives Sable in the Core Vaults and offers to settle the case quietly, dangling berth options for the guild. He hides that his purchases unwind if the theft is ruled.","location_id":"loc_core_vaults","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_kest_inger"],"goal":"Sable wants to trace the first buyer; Kest wants to convert the chart into tether rights and bend the arbitration.","conflict":"Kest's claim-stacking turns courtesy into obligation, and Sable's insistence on procedure keeps her from noticing she is already in his debt.","outcome":"Sable learns Kest bought the map first and sold it on, while Kest learns she can prove it and starts moving faster.","depends_on":["scn_reading_the_seal","scn_rho_at_docks"]}},{"id":"scn_tether_grab","title":"The Tether Grab","summary":"Back at the docks Sable and Rho find that Kest's agents have bought up tethers and stranded pilots who owe ice-tithes. Rho sees the proof that the guild and barons are squeezing the compact.","location_id":"loc_tether_docks","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass","chr_kest_inger"],"goal":"Rho wants to free stranded compact ships; Sable wants to confirm the grab ties to the stolen chart.","conflict":"Kest offers Rho a tether deal for the map, and Rho is tempted because he can