ing to the compact's long exclusion from guild-sealed routes.","location_id":"loc_tether_docks","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass"],"goal":"Sable wants the map surrendered for arbitration; Rho wants to hold it until the compact's claim is conceded.","conflict":"Rho will not admit his fence was wrong because the cause feels right, and Sable's charter calls his holding piracy.","outcome":"Rho agrees to appear at the Long Hall only if the compact's claim is heard, but keeps the map aboard his ship.","depends_on":["scn_reading_the_seal"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Stacked Claims","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_kest_offer","title":"Kest's Offer in the Core Vaults","summary":"Kest Inger receives Sable in the Core Vaults and offers to settle the case quietly, dangling berth options for the guild. He hides that his purchases unwind if the theft is ruled.","location_id":"loc_core_vaults","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_kest_inger"],"goal":"Sable wants to trace the first buyer; Kest wants to convert the chart into tether rights and bend the arbitration.","conflict":"Kest's claim-stacking turns courtesy into obligation, and Sable's insistence on procedure keeps her from noticing she is already in his debt.","outcome":"Sable learns Kest bought the map first and sold it on, while Kest learns she can prove it and starts moving faster.","depends_on":["scn_reading_the_seal","scn_rho_at_docks"]}},{"id":"scn_tether_grab","title":"The Tether Grab","summary":"Back at the docks Sable and Rho find that Kest's agents have bought up tethers and stranded pilots who owe ice-tithes. Rho sees the proof that the guild and barons are squeezing the compact.","location_id":"loc_tether_docks","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass","chr_kest_inger"],"goal":"Rho wants to free stranded compact ships; Sable wants to confirm the grab ties to the stolen chart.","conflict":"Kest offers Rho a tether deal for the map, and Rho is tempted because he cannot admit his fence was wrong.","outcome":"Rho refuses the deal but sails the map out of Sable's reach to the Cinder Gardens to bargain.","depends_on":["scn_kest_offer"]}},{"id":"scn_cinder_gardens_chase","title":"Chase in the Cinder Gardens","summary":"Sable follows Rho into the sunward glasshouses where he meets a grower willing to hide him. With only blades, tethers and harpoons to hand, a swashbuckling chase ends in a standoff above the slag skin.","location_id":"loc_cinder_gardens","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass"],"goal":"Sable wants to bring Rho and the map to the Long Hall; Rho wants to escape with the route intact.","conflict":"Rho's piloting outmatches her on tethers, but her seal-reading lets her show him the proof that the map was opened before he bought it.","outcome":"Rho sees he was sold a stolen map and agrees to a truce, on the condition that she rules on the compact's claim as well.","depends_on":["scn_tether_grab"]}},{"id":"scn_charter_doubt","title":"The Arbiter's Warning","summary":"Sable reports to the arbiter in the Long Hall. The arbiter says the charter's strict reading would hand the map to the guild and strand the pilots, and that Kest has filed to delay the hearing past the burn.","location_id":"loc_long_hall","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_kest_inger"],"goal":"Sable wants the hearing scheduled; Kest wants it postponed past the burn.","conflict":"Procedure supports Kest's delay, and Sable must choose between the charter's letter and its purpose.","outcome":"Sable refuses the delay and calls the hearing for the eve of the burn, accepting that she is now choosing a side.","depends_on":["scn_cinder_gardens_chase"]}}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Hearing","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_hearing_eve_burn","title":"Arbitration on the Eve of the Burn","summary":"In the Long Hall Sable opens the sealed map before all claimants, reads the seal's history aloud, and exposes Kest's purchase and Rho's honest error. Kest tries to stack claims to stall.","location_id":"loc_long_hall","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass","chr_kest_inger"],"goal":"Sable wants to rule on the map by charter and cost; Rho wants the compact's claim conceded; Kest wants the hearing to run past the burn.","conflict":"The burn clock is running, Kest's stacked claims bind the hall, and Rho's bitterness threatens to turn the hearing into a brawl.","outcome":"Sable rules the map stolen but awards the compact route-rights as restitution, unwinds Kest's tether purchases, and Rho surrenders the map.","depends_on":["scn_charter_doubt"]}},{"id":"scn_burn_approach","title":"The Burn Approach","summary":"With the claims settled, Sable and Rho race to the Tether Docks to release stranded ships before perihelion. Rho flies the approach with the freed tethers and sails.","location_id":"loc_tether_docks","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass"],"goal":"Release the stranded pilots' tethers and get the fleet clear before the burn.","conflict":"Kest's remaining agents hold the tethers and there is no time to litigate again.","outcome":"Rho's piloting and Sable's ruling free the fleet, and the ships scatter on the burn as the claims close.","depends_on":["scn_hearing_eve_burn"]}}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"After the Burn","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_kest_collapse","title":"Kest's Claims Collapse","summary":"In the Core Vaults, Kest watches his stacked claims forfeit at perihelion and must choose which debts to honour and which to keep.","location_id":"loc_core_vaults","character_ids":["chr_kest_inger"],"goal":"Salvage what he can of his holdings after the burn.","conflict":"His habit of treating every debt as an asset collides with the debts now collected from him.","outcome":"Kest honours the compact's tithes to keep the barons' berths, a pragmatic concession that costs him his lead.","depends_on":["scn_burn_approach"]}},{"id":"scn_new_route","title":"A Route Won Honestly","summary":"In the Map House Rho and Sable file the compact's new route under guild seal, replacing the stolen chart.","location_id":"loc_map_house","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha","chr_rho_vass"],"goal":"Register a route the compact can hold honestly.","conflict":"Guild clerks resist sealing a pilot-drawn route, and Rho must accept a seal he once refused.","outcome":"The route is sealed jointly and Rho trades the stolen map for a rightful claim.","depends_on":["scn_burn_approach","scn_kest_collapse"]}},{"id":"scn_sable_judgement","title":"The Charter by Its Cost","summary":"Back in the Long Hall Sable tells the arbiter what the ruling cost and proposes the charter be read by its consequences from now on.","location_id":"loc_long_hall","character_ids":["chr_sable_onuoha"],"goal":"Reconcile her faith in procedure with the choice she made.","conflict":"Admitting she chose a side threatens the fair-minded image that shielded her.","outcome":"Sable accepts that judging means choosing, and the arbiter names her to hear the next claim.","depends_on":["scn_new_route"]}}]}]}
